description:
Design a circuit that determines the color output based on the horizontal pixel position, effectively acting as a color bar generator. The module takes a 10-bit input representing the horizontal position (`x_px`) and outputs a 3-bit color value (`color_px`). The output color varies depending on which predefined segment of width 80 pixels the input falls into, assigning specific colors for each segment, thus creating distinct visual bars across a 640-pixel wide display.
module top_module(
            input wire  [9:0] x_px,
            output wire [2:0] color_px
);

