description:
Design a right arithmetic shifter that reduces a 16-bit wide input to a 12-bit wide output. The circuit takes a 16-bit input `data_in` and shifts it right by 4 bits, effectively discarding the least significant bits and producing the most significant 12 bits as the output `data_out`.
module top_module(
data_in,
data_out
);

code:
module top_module(
data_in,
data_out
);parameter in_width = 16;
parameter out_width = 12;


input [in_width-1:0] data_in;
output [out_width-1:0] data_out;

assign data_out = data_in >>> (in_width-out_width);

endmodule

