description:
Design a clock divider that takes an input clock signal and generates a slower output clock signal. The output clock toggles on every 250,000 rising edges of the input clock, effectively dividing the input clock frequency by 500,000. This module is useful in applications where a lower frequency clock is needed for synchronization or timing purposes.
module top_module(
    input clk_in,
    output reg clk_out
    );

code:
module top_module(
    input clk_in,
    output reg clk_out
    );reg [24:0] counter = 0;

    always @(posedge clk_in) begin
        if (counter == 250000) begin
            counter <= 0;
            clk_out <= ~clk_out;
        end else begin
            counter <= counter + 1;
        end
    end

endmodule

